+### §container-not-viewport — the shell's layout step uses a viewport media query
+- Since: 2026-10-23 (overrides the 2026-09-15 decision; the user/maintainer explicitly overrode it)
+- Decision: the shell's layout step uses a viewport `@media (min-width: 720px)` query.
+- Previous decision (2026-09-15, overridden): the shell's layout steps used `@container` queries on `.shell`, and
+  viewport `@media` width queries were forbidden.
+- Previous reason (still a known risk): the shell renders inside split panes as narrow as 380px on a 1440px screen.
+  Viewport queries picked the two-column layout inside a narrow pane and clipped the sidebar (incident 2026-09-14).
+  `.shell { container-type: inline-size; }` is left in place but is no longer used by the layout step.
